  # I've chosen to disable everything that I'm sure I won't need, rather than trying to
  # enable only the components that I do need.
  #
  # - `lib.mkForce` is used to ensure NixOS defaults are overridden.
  #
  # - `unset` allows the kernel's Kconfig to be used as a default, with no error/warning
  #   if the option is never queried for (in that case, it would stay disabled).
  #
  # - `no` will disable the option, with an error if the option is never queried for.
  #
  # - `option no` will disable the option, with a warning if the option is never queried for.
